Not included, but referenced
----------------------------

- LVGL (https://github.com/lvgl/lvgl), MIT License. TreLVis links against
  LVGL but does not include it; consuming projects provide it. The test and
  simulator builds fetch it at build time.
- Material Design 3 (https://m3.material.io) is a design system by Google.
  TreLVis implements its publicly documented token structure and baseline
  values; it does not include Material Design assets.
